---
title: "Care-task reminders: resync, snooze, complete, delete"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: settling
    lg1: settled
    lg2: Breaks SnoozesWithinSlots
    lg3: Path to the SnoozesWithinSlots bug
  }
  class lg0 orange
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 breaks
  class lg3 bugPath
  s0: Settled, permission not read yet, no snooze
  s1: snooze tapped, permission not read yet, no snooze
  s2: resync running + snooze on its way, reminders on, no snooze
  s3: resync running, reminders on, 1 snooze
  s4: resync running + snooze tapped, reminders on, 1 snooze
  s5: resync running + snooze on its way, reminders on, 1 snooze
  s6: resync running, reminders on, 2 snoozes
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: you tap Remind me on a reminder
  s1 --> s2: the snooze looks up the task
  s2 --> s3: the snooze is scheduled
  s3 --> s4: you tap Remind me on a reminder
  s4 --> s5: the snooze looks up the task
  s5 --> s6: the snooze is scheduled
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 blue
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 orange
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 orange
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 orange
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 orange
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 orange
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 orange
  class s6 breaks
  class s6 bugPath
